Tom Sevy wrote:
> 
> I've updated the SRM to latester version (shipping with Tru64) but the
> system continues to boot into ARC and not SRM.
> 
> Can anyone tell me what I am doing (or not doing) wrong?

Make sure you have installed the bios for the -au, not the bios for the -a. Then, go into
the arc bios and set os type from the menus, then power down the machine, then power up
again.

It does work, have updated a -a 433 to -au bios with no problems, but you do need a du
supported scsi adapter and video card to make it all fly.

Chris



