      1469        1613    vmtables         144 /    1.12M
      1613       10240     managed        8627 /   67.40M
                             ============================
         Total Physical Memory Use:       9983 /   77.99M

Managed Pages Break Down:

       free pages = 151
     active pages = 3782
   inactive pages = 2015
      wired pages = 2686
        ubc pages = 2385
        ==================
            Total = 11019

WIRED Pages Break Down:

